# ─── Server ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3001
HOST=0.0.0.0
LOG_LEVEL=info

# ─── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: Docker Postgres on port 5434 (started with: docker compose up -d)
# Production (Supabase): use the POOLED url (Transaction mode, port 6543) for
# Railway/Fly/serverless; direct port 5432 will exhaust connections at scale.
# Format: postgresql://postgres.[ref]:[pw]@aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://sangam:sangam@localhost:5434/sangam

# ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase JWT secret — Project Settings → API → JWT Settings → JWT Secret
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=replace-me

# ─── CORS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000

# ─── Cache (Redis) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: spun up by docker compose on port 6381 (isolated from any other
# Redis on this machine, including the default 6379).
# Production: point at managed Redis (Upstash, Redis Cloud, Railway add-on).
# Without REDIS_URL set the cache silently no-ops — API still works, just slower.
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6381

# ─── AI providers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional in V0 dev — required when the AI waiter / manager console are used.
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint works (the env var is named
# DEEPSEEK_* for legacy reasons but is provider-agnostic).
#
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL defaults to OpenRouter (https://openrouter.ai/api/v1) — NOT
# the China-hosted DeepSeek API — because customer/financial data must not transit
# api.deepseek.com (data sovereignty + India regulatory risk). Settle never calls
# an LLM, so settlement data is unaffected regardless.
#
# Pick ONE setup:
#   • OpenRouter (recommended): key sk-or-..., DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat,
#     leave DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL unset (uses the OpenRouter default).
#   • DeepSeek direct (DEV/TESTING ONLY — China-hosted): key sk-...,
#     DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat, DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
#   • Gemini / Sarvam: set GEMINI_API_KEY (or point DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL at their
#     OpenAI-compatible endpoint).
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ─── Payments (Razorpay) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional in V0 dev. Use test keys until prod cutover.
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
